OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA warm, dry and bright day with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunny spells and light
OL,7,Fwinds. Clouding over in the evening
OL,8,Fperhaps with some outbreaks of rain.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FTurning increasingly cloudy
OL,11,Ffrom the west during the evening with
OL,12,Foutbreaks of light and patchy rain
OL,13,Fpushing across the region during the
OL,14,Fearly hours.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FTurning rather warm and humid
OL,17,Fon Monday with an increasing chance of
OL,18,Fshowers during the afternoon, these
OL,19,Fbecoming more frequent and heavier
OL,20,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
