OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRather
OL,6,Fchangeable with sunny spells and
OL,7,Fshowers, these potentially heavy and
OL,8,Fthundery on Tuesday. Turning somewhat
OL,9,Fdrier from Wednesday, with
OL,10,Ftemperatures returning to average.
